{"agent_id":"pp3g-ByWC-read-only-audit-for-issue-463-no-mutations-no-commits","agent_seq":8,"timestamp":"2026-08-25T02:01:45.234078667Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"0a11c243-ee78-4432-a2f3-0d4dbf5b02d9","comment_uuid":"251472b7-b809-4ddd-a179-6220a6f8114a","author":"pp3g-ByWC-read-only-audit-for-issue-463-no-mutations-no-commits","content":"RESULT: Read-only audit of /home/claude-code/projects/Tools complete (no mutations made to subject repo; one intervention logged).\n\n== 1. SYNC/STATUS VERDICT TABLE ==\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Branch | main |\n| Working tree | DIRTY: 3 modified (.crosslink/.last-hydrated-ref, .crosslink/rules/global.md, scripts/claude), 3 untracked (.claude/findings-interrupt-plugin.md, .opencode/command/interrupt.md, .worktrees/8AZ1-BHCW-.../) |\n| Ahead/behind vs origin/main | ahead 1 / behind 0 — BUT vs CACHED tracking ref (9fede33a, 2026-07-15); live 'git fetch origin' FAILED: GitHub auth rejected ('Invalid username or token') |\n| Stash list | NOT COLLECTED — guard blocks any command containing token 'stash' (intervention logged, tool_blocked) |\n| Origin URL (VERBATIM — permanent archive citation) | https://github.com/rock-solid-sites/rss-tools.git |\n| Last commit | be99438ec835c4b793537192e027c6c0f54be27f — 2026-07-31 18:06:49 +0000 — 'docs: fix stale OpenCode agent/plugin/model documentation (#105)' |\n| .git size | 3.3M (422 loose objects, 0 packs) |\n\nClaim discipline (sync): WHY archive-readiness needs divergence truth; WHAT rev-list counts + porcelain status observed directly; HOW CERTAIN evidence-based for LOCAL state, GUESS-grade for remote state; WHAT-NOT-TESTED whether be99438e actually exists on GitHub (fetch auth-blocked — local-only commit is UNCONFIRMED-ON-REMOTE), stash inventory.\n\n== 2. HISTORY NARRATIVE ==\n6 commits, 2026-07-09 (a0a951d) → 2026-07-31 (be99438e); ~3 weeks of activity, single main branch. Top level at HEAD: .claude/ .crosslink/ agents/ crosslink/ instructions/ plugins/ scripts/